networks is unmatched, and they’ve played a crucial role in helping us stay at the forefront of the industry. The level of service and attention to detail they provide is exceptional.” ... “Outsourcing our IT support to AlphaStone Contracting was a game-changer for us. Their cost-effective solutions and skilled IT resources have allowed our government services to operate seamlessly.\nOur dedicated support team is available round the clock to address any concerns or issues that may arise, ensuring that our clients receive prompt and reliable assistance. With AlphaStone Contracting as your partner, you can trust that your telecommunication and IT network solutions are in capable hands.","domain":"alphastonecontracting.com","createdAt":"2026-05-03T09:28:32.863Z"},{"id":"4b71e882-8936-41de-a67a-606b0495fdd3","queryId":"15d5b725-8b6b-470b-800f-88750e9c4e8a","title":"China Telecom Americas | Cloud, Data Center & Network Solutions | Connecting the World","url":"https://www.ctamericas.com/","snippet":"Our IP Transit and CDN services help customers reach over 60% of all China’s wireline and wireless internet infrastructure, and deliver edge content to ChinaNet subscribers from 30+ global PoPs. ... With 5G service commencing in 2019, CT has been rapidly upgrading infrastructure and growing its 5G subscriber base reaching nearly 200M customers in China.\nChina Telecom Americas (CTA) supports global businesses with custom, end-to-end network, cloud, and data center services in China and beyond.\nOur IP Transit and CDN services help customers reach over 60% of all China’s wireline and wireless internet infrastructure, and deliver edge content to ChinaNet subscribers from 30+ global PoPs. ... With 5G service commencing in 2019, CT has been rapidly upgrading infrastructure and growing its 5G subscriber base reaching nearly 200M customers in China.","domain":"ctamericas.com","createdAt":"2026-05-03T09:28:32.863Z"},{"id":"0edd6025-7fc4-47b8-a2c6-6593f6fd1b0f","queryId":"15d5b725-8b6b-470b-800f-88750e9c4e8a","title":"MoU targets UAE wireless infrastructure market - Developing Telecoms","url":"https://developingtelecoms.com/telecom-technology/wireless-networks/19188-mou-targets-uae-wireless-infrastructure-market.html","snippet":"The companies explain that the agreement outlines a comprehensive framework for cooperation in the development, deployment and integration of innovative wireless infrastructure. This collaboration will target enterprise and smart city environments. Key areas of focus include indoor and outdoor coverage enhancement, mission-critical communications technologies, high security networking solutions, gigabit throughput wireless connectivity and the adoption of open and interoperable 5G radio access networks based on Comba’s 5G private network solutions to support future-proof telecommunications infrastructure.\nWireless solutions company Comba Telecom Limited, and Nedaa Professional Communication Corporation, a provider of mission-critical communications and secure technology platforms, have announced the signing of a memorandum of understanding (MoU) to establish a strategic collaboration aimed at advancing next-generation telecommunications solutions in the UAE and beyond.\nThe companies explain that the agreement outlines a comprehensive framework for cooperation in the development, deployment and integration of innovative wireless infrastructure. This collaboration will target enterprise and smart city environments. Key areas of focus include indoor and outdoor coverage enhancement, mission-critical communications technologies, high security networking solutions, gigabit throughput wireless connectivity and the adoption of open and interoperable 5G radio access networks based on Comba’s 5G private network solutions to support future-proof telecommunications infrastructure.\nThey add that Comba’s extensive experience in designing and deploying advanced radio access networks, combined with Nedaa’s leadership in secure communications and mission-critical technology platforms, positions the collaboration to deliver high-impact, scalable solutions for both public and private sector clients. The partnership also aligns with the UAE’s broader objectives to enhance digital infrastructure, accelerate smart city initiatives, and strengthen national resilience in telecommunications. Both organisations will initially focus on pilot projects to validate new solutions, with plans to expand into larger-scale deployments as the collaboration progresses.\nComba is a wireless solutions provider with its own R&D facilities, manufacturing base, and sales and service teams. Nedaa was established by government decree in 2008.","domain":"developingtelecoms.com","createdAt":"2026-05-03T09:28:32.863Z"}]},{"id":"00002dc3-b6ca-4896-b592-df47b73d1f9e","taskId":"6d5b119c-088f-4799-97c4-fb5d56f7459a","provider":"brave","operatorSource":"brave_official","executionStatus":"completed","operatorName":"boolean_or negative_term","strategyTemplate":"\"telecom equipment\" (\"system integrator\" OR \"stockist\" OR \"telecom contractor\" OR \"network maintenance\") {country} (\"Huawei\" OR \"ZTE\" OR RRU OR BBU) {exclude}","query":"\"telecom equipment\" (\"system integrator\" OR \"stockist\" OR \"telecom contractor\" OR \"network maintenance\") Saudi Arabia (\"Huawei\" OR \"ZTE\" OR RRU OR BBU) -job -jobs -career -news -training -\"consumer phone\" -blog -marketplace -Alibaba -Accio -TradeWheel -Made-in-China","keywordGroups":{"brandTerms":["Huawei","ZTE","Ericsson","Nokia","Eltek","Delta","Vertiv"],"marketTerms":["UAE","Saudi Arabia","Nigeria","Kenya","Russia","Ukraine"],"excludeTerms":["job","jobs","career","news","training","consumer phone","consumer","course","forum","blog","youtube","facebook","linkedin","wiki","marketplace","Alibaba","Accio","TradeWheel","Made-in-China","GlobalSources","IndiaMART","TradeIndia","EC21","ExportHub","Go4WorldBusiness","Amazon","AliExpress","China","Chinese","cn"],"productTerms":["5G tel